
FORM 1 before TRUE late(x)
marginplyr_error Contextual share requires source summary `s` to be defined exactly once.
ℹ Use one uniquely named ordinary summary.

FORM 1 before FALSE late(x)
marginplyr_error Contextual share requires source summary `s` to be defined exactly once.
ℹ Use one uniquely named ordinary summary.

FORM 2 before TRUE tibble(s = 100 * sum(x))
marginplyr_error Contextual share requires source summary `s` to be defined exactly once.
ℹ Use one uniquely named ordinary summary.

FORM 2 before FALSE tibble(s = 100 * sum(x))
marginplyr_error Contextual share requires source summary `s` to be defined exactly once.
ℹ Use one uniquely named ordinary summary.

FORM 3 before TRUE late_p(x)
marginplyr_error Total-share output name `p` conflicts with an ordinary summary.

FORM 3 before FALSE late_p(x)
marginplyr_error Total-share output name `p` conflicts with an ordinary summary.

FORM 4 before TRUE tibble(p = 100 * sum(x))
marginplyr_error Total-share output name `p` conflicts with an ordinary summary.

FORM 4 before FALSE tibble(p = 100 * sum(x))
marginplyr_error Total-share output name `p` conflicts with an ordinary summary.

FORM 5 before TRUE late_g(x)
marginplyr_error Summary results cannot overwrite grouping column:
ℹ `g`.

FORM 5 before FALSE late_g(x)
marginplyr_error Summary results cannot overwrite grouping column:
ℹ `g`.

FORM 6 before TRUE late_set(x)
marginplyr_error `.id` (`set`) conflicts with a summary output.

FORM 6 before FALSE late_set(x)
marginplyr_error `.id` (`set`) conflicts with a summary output.

